1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,981
AI can call a football match.

2
00:00:02,021 --> 00:00:03,525
Can it prove what it says?

3
00:00:03,565 --> 00:00:07,680
CRONISTA is a multi-agent broadcast where
every sentence is traceable.

4
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:15,858
Two LLM coaches on separate Azure OpenAI
deployments receive the same committed
observation and return a plan for every player.

5
00:00:15,898 --> 00:00:20,040
A shared deterministic engine resolves the
play; the clock waits for both.

6
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:24,951
Plans are validated against the engine.

7
00:00:24,991 --> 00:00:30,601
An invalid or late answer gets one correction with
feedback, then a recorded programmed fallback.

8
00:00:30,641 --> 00:00:31,940
The match never stalls.

9
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:37,680
Narrator (play-by-play): Lucio Breloera scores the goal!

10
00:00:39,646 --> 00:00:41,494
Narrator (template): Over to you, Priya.

11
00:00:41,534 --> 00:00:46,262
Commentator (LLM, verified): Lucio Breloera
(10) scores for Racing Torreluna.

12
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,988
The commentator may only analyse with a cited fact.

13
00:00:50,028 --> 00:00:54,085
Eight deterministic rules check
citations, numbers, names and claims.

14
00:00:54,125 --> 00:00:58,360
A failed sentence is retried once, then
replaced by a labelled template.

15
00:00:59,350 --> 00:01:05,925
A versioned Microsoft Foundry agent answers viewer questions
with read-only tools over the confirmed play only.

16
00:01:05,965 --> 00:01:08,130
Its sentences pass the same verifier.

17
00:01:10,950 --> 00:01:14,403
Spanish or English, fan, analyst or one player:

18
00:01:14,443 --> 00:01:17,970
the same intelligence, rendered for each viewer.

19
00:01:18,360 --> 00:01:20,900
[Spanish desk audio: a four-voice round
recorded in the public arena on 21 Oct]

20
00:01:21,350 --> 00:01:23,870
The same verifier guards the automated recap:

21
00:01:23,910 --> 00:01:29,104
click any sentence to see its events and open the
process view with every draft and verdict.

22
00:01:29,144 --> 00:01:31,380
We claim traceability, not better prose.

23
00:01:33,300 --> 00:01:39,031
It runs on Azure Container Apps with Blob, Key Vault,
Application Insights, Speech and Foundry.

24
00:01:39,071 --> 00:01:41,825
Nearly two thousand automated tests run in CI.

25
00:01:41,865 --> 00:01:43,283
Everything is synthetic.

26
00:01:43,323 --> 00:01:46,320
CRONISTA: narrate the match, prove every sentence.
